    <!--
      Naming: <area>_<element>. Areas match the ui/ package names, so a string
      is findable from the screen it appears on and vice versa.

      Country names are NOT here. They come from Locale.getDisplayCountry(), so
      they are already localised in every language Android supports. See
      ui/auth/Country.kt.

      Translators: %1$s style placeholders must keep their numbering, and the
      order they appear in a sentence may differ per language. German runs about
      30% longer than English, so avoid padding these out.
    -->
